  {
   "settings": {
    "analyzable": {
     "text": {
      "orig": "Game Tester",
      "transl": "Spieletester"
     }
    },
    "npcStates": [
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Oh now look who it is!",
          "transl": "Oh, sieh an, wer da ist!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hi!",
          "transl": "Привіт!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "EXCITED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Could not imagine a better person to show up right now, too.",
          "transl": "Ich hätte mir niemand Besseren vorstellen können, der hier auftaucht!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "ANNOYED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Oh, hehe. Looks like you already know what I'm going to ask?",
          "transl": "Oh, hehe. Du weißt also schon, was ich dich fragen will?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[киває]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Well... \\. That makes things easy then!",
          "transl": "Gut...\\. Das macht die Sache einfacher!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SMILE"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I got a new job testing parkours, but this time it needs to be done within a time limit.",
          "transl": "Ich habe eine neue Aufgabe zum Testen eines Parcours bekommen, nur dieses Mal mit einem Zeitlimit."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Sounds pretty dope, right? But also like... \\. lots of work, and I might start sweating even.",
          "transl": "Klingt ziemlich cool, oder? Aber auch irgendwie...\\. nach viel Arbeit, sogar schweißtreibender Arbeit."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Who would have thought this job could be so hard?",
          "transl": "Wer hätte gedacht, dass dieser Job so hart sein könnte?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "You'd imagine that running around as an avatar wouldn't really exhaust you.",
          "transl": "Und dann hörst du überall, dass das Rumlaufen als Avatar überhaupt nicht anstrengend ist..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Anyway, what do you say? Wanna help me do this?",
          "transl": "Egal, was sagst du? Willst du mir dabei helfen?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "accepted": [
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "[nods]",
            "transl": "[киває]"
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "NOD"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Sweet potatoes! ",
            "transl": "Astrein!"
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Alright, let's see...",
            "transl": "Gut, einen Moment..."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          null,
          {
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Okay, there we go. Just walk through this point like last time. ",
            "transl": "Okay, kann losgehen. Lauf einfach über diesen Punkt, so wie beim letzten Mal."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "The timer will start automatically and you'll have to finish before it runs out.",
            "transl": "Der Timer startet automatisch, und du musst die Aufgabe beenden, bevor er abgelaufen ist."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Pretty simple stuff, really. I'm sure you can handle it!",
            "transl": "Ziemlich einfach also. Ich bin sicher, dass du das kannst!"
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "...",
            "transl": "..."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "SMILE"
           }
          }
         ],
         "declined": [
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "[shakes head]",
            "transl": "[хитає головою]"
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "SHAKE"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Oh man, what a bummer.",
            "transl": "Oh Mann, und ich dachte echt..."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Come back if you change your mind... ",
            "transl": "Komm wieder, falls du deine Meinung änderst..."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "... I'll just wait here.",
            "transl": "... Ich werde hier einfach warten."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "...",
            "transl": "..."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "ANNOYED"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Just go to the start marker on the left. Time will start automatically.",
         "transl": "Geh einfach zum Marker auf der linken Seite. Die Zeit startet dann automatisch."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "But don't leave or it'll reset. Really annoying, I know.",
         "transl": "Sie wird zurückgesetzt, sobald du den Parcours verlässt. Das kann ziemlich nerven."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "What are you doing? You only have \\v[timers.roundBergenTimer.formatRemainingTime] left.",
         "transl": "Was tust du denn da? Du hast nur noch \\v[timers.roundBergenTimer.formatRemainingTime] Zeit!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Wow, that looked so taxing. But you pulled through.",
          "transl": "Woah, das sah echt krass aus. Aber du hast es geschafft."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "And you didn't even break a sweat. Do you work out or something?",
          "transl": "Und du schwitzt nicht mal. Treibst du etwa Sport oder so?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "CHARMED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "And nothing weird happened, right? No sudden strokes or anything?",
          "transl": "Und nichts Komisches passiert, oder? Keine plötzlichen Schocks oder so?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[shakes head]",
          "transl": "[хитає головою]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SHAKE"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "My boss will be thrilled! ",
          "transl": "Mein Chef wird begeistert sein!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "CHARMED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Thanks so much... \\. again! You really nail these tracks.",
          "transl": "Dank dir vielmals...\\. wieder einmal! Du hast diesen Hürdenlauf echt drauf."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "We make a great team, don't you think?",
          "transl": "Wir geben ein tolles Team ab, findest du nicht auch?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SMILE"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[киває]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Okay, right. I'll go do my report now. Until next time!",
          "transl": "Hehe. Dann geh ich mal meinen Bericht abliefern. Bis demnächst!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "thenStep": [
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Bye.",
